  "worked_solution": "The cube root of a product of two numbers is equal to the product of the cube roots of the numbers. Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\sqrt[3]{32}=\\sqrt[3]{8\\cdot 4}=\\sqrt[3]{8}\\cdot \\sqrt[3]{4}=2\\sqrt[3]{4}.\n$$",
